<title>USA: Eagle BancGroup to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Eagle BancGroup to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMINGTON, Ill. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eagle BancGroup Inc said Wednesday it is implementing a program to repurchase up to five percent or 65,000 shares of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>Donald Fernandes, president and chief executive officer of the company, said in a news release that the repurchase program represents an attractive use of capital relative to other investment alternatives.</p>
<p>The stock closed unchanged at 15 Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
